# Local-First Rules (full doc: docs/local-first.md)

## Write Flow

1. Write to IndexedDB (Dexie) first
2. Update UI immediately (optimistic)
3. Sync to homeserver in background
4. Reconcile conflicts asynchronously

## Controller Naming

| Prefix | Behavior |
|--------|----------|
| `fetch*` | Network only |
| `get*` | Local only |
| `getOrFetch*` | Local first, network fallback |
| `commit[Create\|Update\|Delete]*` | Local-first write + background sync |

## useLiveQuery

- Pure, read-only, local-only inside useLiveQuery
- NEVER call TanStack Query or network code inside useLiveQuery (breaks Dexie PSD)
- Pattern: fetch in useEffect, read in useLiveQuery

## Persistence Order

Persist dependencies first: author → post → tags (not the reverse).

For full patterns, code examples, and optimistic update strategies: read docs/local-first.md
